    <comment> Mar 4/5 - HST 57 w/ road closure and sz 2.5 on gravel slope on road &amp;amp; sz 2.5 on road from Sask North. need skidoos to close road. Tues Mar 5 - Heli AC on Parker, Sask N&amp;amp;S, Weeping wall upper, Cirrus, Sunset, Wilson proper &amp;amp; Wilson S w/ limited results. All had slid natural on buried SH. Also heli AC on coleman cliffs upper, camp 3 lower and 1 into coleman heli. Case/hand charges on hilda sidecut w/ NR. since mar 09 HST 66cm settled to 45 on storm board. Mod/St SW winds w/ frontal passage and str SW upper elev winds this PM. Expect slab development on lee asp w/ avy activity on buried SH layer where it hadn&amp;apos;t slid last week. Last week had warm temps and freezing level up to 1600m. </comment>
